            "title": "Vaccine makers fall on FDA memo, Bally's wins bid for NYC casino",
            "description": "<p>Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including the stock hit vaccine makers Moderna (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MRNA\">MRNA</a>), BioNTech (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BNTX\">BNTX</a>), and Novavax (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVAX\">NVAX</a>) are taking on following a memo from the US Food and Drug Administration (FDA); casino operator Bally's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BALY\">BALY</a>) has won approval to run casinos in New York City; and Somnigroup International's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SGI\">SGI</a>) $1.6 billion offer to acquire Leggett & Platt (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LEG\">LEG</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
